    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HF9R5PM3Q81RV6JA7ZN946F1\">Contact support</h2><div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>If you are on a free or paid plan, log into your Klaviyo account and use our support page at <a href=\"https://www.klaviyo.com/support\" target=\"_self\">klaviyo.com/support</a>.</p>\n<p>If you are locked out of your account or have an invoice inquiry, please submit a ticket though our <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/requests/new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">request form</a>.</p>\n</div><h2 id=\"h_01HF9R5PM37AW3ZNXZ3EXV7M93\">Support for free vs. paid plans</h2><p>We offer email and live chat support to customers on all paid plans.</p><p>Customers on free plans have access to a 60-day trial of email support, along with a variety of other resources including the <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Help Center</a>, <a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"undefined\">Academy</a>, <a href=\"https://community.klaviyo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Klaviyo Community</a>, and interactive <a href=\"https://www.klaviyo.com/events/live-training\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">live trainings</a>. </p><h2 id=\"h_01HF9R5PM37AAAY9QMYZZVH0MX\">Klaviyo support hours</h2><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table wysiwyg-table-align-left\" style=\"height: 132px; width: 100%;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: #eee; height: 22px; width: 33.3333%;\"> </td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eee; height: 22px; width: 33.3333%;\"><strong>Email</strong></td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eee; height: 22px; width: 33.3333%;\"><strong>Live chat </strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 44px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 16.6667%;\">Paid Accounts</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 33.3333%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 33.3333%;\">24/5, weekend hours vary by plan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 16.6667%;\">Free Users</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 33.3333%;\">Access in their first 60 days</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 33.3333%;\">Virtual assistant</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></figure><h3 id=\"h_01HF9W5XRKFRZ7X2Y5FN483CK0\">Local business hours</h3><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table wysiwyg-table-align-left\" style=\"height: 110px; width: 100%;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; height: 22px; width: 25%;\"><strong>Region</strong></td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; height: 22px; width: 25%;\"><strong>Hours</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 25%;\">Americas</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 25%;\">9 a.m.–8 p.m. Eastern Time</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 25%;\">Asia-Pacific</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 25%;\">9 a.m.–5 p.m. Australian Eastern Time</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 44px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 25%;\">Europe, Middle East, Africa</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 25%;\">9 a.m.–5 p.m. Greenwich Mean Time/British Summer Time</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></figure><h3 id=\"01KA95SQBCSYF4CF6EC42GFYZD\">BFCM Support Hours</h3><p>We offer additional email and live chat support hours on Thanksgiving and through Cyber Monday for all customers on paid plans:</p><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table wysiwyg-table-align-left\" style=\"height: 132px; width: 100%;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; height: 22px; width: 19.3333%;\"> </td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; height: 22px; width: 19.3333%;\"><strong>Thanksgiving</strong></td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; height: 22px; width: 17.6666%;\"><strong>Black Friday</strong></td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; width: 15.762%;\"><strong>Saturday</strong></td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; width: 15.7381%;\"><strong>Sunday</strong></td>\n<td style=\"background-color: #eeeeee; width: 12.1667%;\"><strong>Cyber Monday</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 44px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 19.3333%;\">Live Chat</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 19.3333%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 17.6666%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 15.762%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 15.7381%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 44px; width: 12.1667%;\">24/7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 19.3333%;\">Email Support</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 19.3333%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 17.6666%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 15.762%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 15.7381%;\">24/7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 22px; width: 12.1667%;\">24/7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></figure><h2 id=\"h_01HF9R5PM3ZMW60JR96KS8SF42\">How to contact support in-app</h2><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"efe916e6c25706fa240686ab5c40bd7b0\">When you're logged in to your account, select <strong>Support</strong> in the top right of the app or navigate to <a href=\"https://www.klaviyo.com/support\">klaviyo.com/support</a>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/39792783258651\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed3648ddd5822a67326e33fa57b2ea3ed\">Review the common questions, or select <strong>Email support </strong>or <strong>Chat support </strong>to contact us directly. <ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e27cd9f5ef27bb5f1e19bd1836a82cf12\">For email support: fill out and submit the form.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ece862e21ce70381b67425e3fede9adc0\">For chat support: start by asking your question to Kira, Klaviyo’s Virtual Product Expert.<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef67029a970f816f0f920ca38d117c450\">Enter your question into the associated chatbox.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2b7efcb05bc00f61dba7115770d2bd11\">Kira will direct you to any applicable resources or solutions.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e64b5f40319081e4b5e6a432b26dfc815\">If Kira is unable to answer your question and you are on a paid plan, you will be added to our live chat queue, where you will be able to speak with a member of our support team.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol><p>If you aren't able to access email or chat support within the <em>Need further assistance?</em> section of the widget, you can access them by clicking the <strong>Support</strong> link to <a href=\"https://www.klaviyo.com/support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">klaviyo.com/support</a>.</p><h2 id=\"h_01F8ZKVKE3N8F9VF8NFWVDHNT0\">The Community</h2><p>The best answers to your questions can often come from other Klaviyo users. The <a href=\"https://community.klaviyo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Klaviyo Community</a> is a place for you to learn, grow, and share best practices to level up your marketing strategy and skillset.</p><p>There, you can share strategic ideas, provide insight into topics you’re familiar with, and ask questions in a supportive peer-driven environment. Create an account using your Klaviyo login email to join the conversation and learn from users like yourself.</p><p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34957993633435\" alt=\"Klaviyo Community, a forum where you can ask and get answers to all of your Klaviyo questions\"></p><h2 id=\"h_01HF9R5PM30RQSQNYGKAEWPKTF\">Unable to access chat?</h2><p>Some ad-blocking software or browser add-ons may prevent the chat option from appearing in your account dropdown menu.</p><p>If you're on a paid plan and you're experiencing difficulties accessing chat, try disabling any ad blockers or browser add-ons.</p><p>If the problem persists, reach out to our success team by clicking <strong>Support &gt; Email support</strong>.</p><h2 id=\"h_01HF9R5PM33C142PQAJAF1DQ42\">Unable to log into your Klaviyo account?</h2><p>If you have been locked out or are unable to log into your Klaviyo account, please submit a ticket through our <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/requests/new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">account access request form</a>. From here, a member of our support team will assist in retrieving your access.</p><h2 id=\"h_01HF9R5PM3KK7DP5X6V8NKY954\">Additional resources</h2><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e143ccaa5f33e48fd6457b5586048a64e\"><a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/getting-started-with-klaviyo/1405979\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Getting started with Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e009b578530d905e6f06ecd1cb27bf250\"><a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Klaviyo Academy</a></li>\n</ul>",
